{...JSON.parse("{\"id\":\"validator-profile\",\"title\":\"Validator profile (Ajv)\",\"hostRequirements\":[\"Install the extended validator profile in spec.md; plain JSON Schema validation does not implement transforms, dynamic defaults or custom error messages.\"],\"config\":{\"showUnfocusedDescription\":true,\"restrict\":true,\"jsonformsExtended\":{\"security\":{\"allowScriptEvaluation\":true}}},\"data\":{\"fullName\":\"Jo\",\"email\":\"not-an-address\",\"seats\":9,\"reference\":\"xx-1\",\"tidy\":{\"code\":\"  ab-12  \",\"town\":\"  north harbour  \",\"note\":\"  please seat us together  \",\"level\":\"  intermediate  \"},\"spoken\":{\"age\":12,\"postcode\":\"12\"}},\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"title\":\"Course enrolment\",\"properties\":{\"fullName\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Full name\",\"minLength\":3},\"email\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Email\",\"format\":\"email\"},\"seats\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"title\":\"Seats\",\"minimum\":1,\"maximum\":4},\"reference\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Reference\",\"pattern\":\"^[A-Z]{2}-[0-9]{4}$\"},\"tidy\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"title\":\"Normalised on validation\",\"properties\":{\"code\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Code (trimmed, upper-cased)\",\"transform\":[\"trim\",\"toUpperCase\"]},\"town\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Town (start case)\",\"transform\":[\"trim\",\"startCase\"]},\"note\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Note (capitalized)\",\"transform\":[\"trim\",\"capitalize\"]},\"level\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Level (matched to a choice)\",\"transform\":[\"trim\",\"toEnumCase\"],\"enum\":[\"Beginner\",\"Intermediate\",\"Advanced\"]}}},\"defaults\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"title\":\"Filled in before you arrive\",\"default\":{},\"properties\":{\"currency\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Currency (a plain default)\",\"default\":\"EUR\"},\"confirmed\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"title\":\"Confirmed (a false default, preserved)\",\"default\":false},\"opensOn\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Opens (today)\"},\"closesOn\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Closes (in two weeks)\"},\"requestedAt\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Requested at\"},\"year\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"title\":\"Year\"}},\"dynamicDefaults\":{\"opensOn\":{\"func\":\"date\",\"args\":{}},\"closesOn\":{\"func\":\"date\",\"args\":{\"duration\":\"P14D\"}},\"requestedAt\":{\"func\":\"datetime\",\"args\":{}},\"year\":{\"func\":\"dateUnit\",\"args\":{\"unit\":\"year\"}}}},\"request\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"title\":\"Taken from the page address\",\"default\":{},\"properties\":{\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"ref\"},\"campaign\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"campaign\"},\"source\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"source\"}},\"dynamicDefaults\":{\"ref\":{\"func\":\"searchParams\",\"args\":{\"param\":\"ref\"}},\"campaign\":{\"func\":\"searchParams\",\"args\":{\"param\":\"campaign\"}},\"source\":{\"func\":\"searchParams\",\"args\":{\"param\":\"source\"}}}},\"computed\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"title\":\"Computed by a function in the schema\",\"default\":{},\"properties\":{\"greeting\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Greeting\"}},\"dynamicDefaults\":{\"greeting\":{\"func\":\"dynamic\",\"args\":{\"who\":\"student\",\"func\":\"(args) => `Welcome, ${args.who}.`\"}}}},\"spoken\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"title\":\"Messages written into the schema\",\"properties\":{\"nickname\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Nickname\",\"minLength\":2},\"age\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"title\":\"Age\",\"minimum\":16},\"postcode\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"Postcode\",\"pattern\":\"^[0-9]{4}$\"}},\"required\":[\"nickname\"],\"errorMessage\":{\"required\":{\"nickname\":\"nicknameRequired\"},\"properties\":{\"nickname\":\"nicknameTooShort\",\"age\":\"tooYoung\",\"postcode\":\"A postcode is four digits, like 1010.\"}}}},\"required\":[\"fullName\"]},\"translations\":{\"en\":{\"intro.text\":\"Everything here is the validator, not the renderers. Switch the form's language and watch the messages change without a single error key in this catalog.\",\"errorsTab.label\":\"Errors\",\"transformTab.label\":\"transform\",\"defaultsTab.label\":\"Defaults\",\"messagesTab.label\":\"Messages in the schema\",\"errors.text\":\"Ordinary keyword failures. The wording is Ajv's own, translated by ajv-i18n - this catalog defines no error text at all.\",\"transform.text\":\"transform normalises the value as a side effect of validating. Blur a field and the stored data changes: trimmed, upper-cased, start-cased, or matched to the nearest declared choice.\",\"defaults.text\":\"A schema default is written into the data on first validation - including false, which is why Confirmed stays unticked rather than being treated as missing. The four below it are computed: today, today plus two weeks, now, and this year.\",\"request.text\":\"dynamicDefaults can read the page address, so an object field arrives holding the current request parameters. Add ?ref=AB-1234&campaign=spring to the URL and reload.\",\"computed.text\":\"dynamic compiles a function written in the schema. It needs jsonformsExtended.security.allowScriptEvaluation, which this example grants; without it the field stays empty and the console says why.\",\"messages.text\":\"These messages come from the schema, not from the validator. A message may be a catalog key - the first two are - or a sentence, which is used as written.\",\"error.errorMessage.nicknameRequired\":\"Please choose a nickname.\",\"error.errorMessage.nicknameTooShort\":\"A nickname needs at least two characters.\",\"error.errorMessage.tooYoung\":\"Enrolment is open from 16.\"},\"bg\":{\"intro.text\":\"Всичко тук е на валидатора, а не на визуализаторите. Сменете езика на формуляра и вижте как съобщенията се променят без нито един ключ за грешка в този каталог.\",\"errorsTab.label\":\"Грешки\",\"transformTab.label\":\"transform\",\"defaultsTab.label\":\"Стойности по подразбиране\",\"messagesTab.label\":\"Съобщения в схемата\",\"errors.text\":\"Обикновени нарушения на ключови думи. Текстът е на Ajv, преведен от ajv-i18n - този каталог не съдържа никакъв текст за грешки.\",\"transform.text\":\"transform нормализира стойността като страничен ефект от валидирането. Напуснете полето и запазените данни се променят: изчистени, с главни букви или съпоставени с най-близкия обявен избор.\",\"defaults.text\":\"Стойност по подразбиране от схемата се записва в данните при първото валидиране - включително false, затова Потвърдено остава неотметнато, вместо да се смята за липсващо. Четирите под него се изчисляват: днес, днес плюс две седмици, сега и тази година.\",\"request.text\":\"dynamicDefaults може да чете адреса на страницата, така че обектно поле пристига със сегашните параметри на заявката. Добавете ?ref=AB-1234&campaign=spring към адреса и презаредете.\",\"computed.text\":\"dynamic компилира функция, написана в схемата. Изисква jsonformsExtended.security.allowScriptEvaluation, което този пример дава; без него полето остава празно, а конзолата обяснява защо.\",\"messages.text\":\"Тези съобщения идват от схемата, а не от валидатора. Съобщението може да е ключ от каталога - първите две са - или изречение, което се използва както е написано.\",\"error.errorMessage.nicknameRequired\":\"Моля, изберете псевдоним.\",\"error.errorMessage.nicknameTooShort\":\"Псевдонимът трябва да е поне два знака.\",\"error.errorMessage.tooYoung\":\"Записването е от 16 години.\"}},\"uischema\":{\"type\":\"VerticalLayout\",\"options\":{\"gap\":\"1rem\"},\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"Label\",\"i18n\":\"intro\"},{\"type\":\"Categorization\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"Category\",\"name\":\"errors\",\"i18n\":\"errorsTab\",\"label\":\"Errors\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"Label\",\"i18n\":\"errors\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/fullName\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/email\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/seats\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/reference\"}]},{\"type\":\"Category\",\"name\":\"transform\",\"i18n\":\"transformTab\",\"label\":\"transform\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"Label\",\"i18n\":\"transform\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/tidy\"}]},{\"type\":\"Category\",\"name\":\"defaults\",\"i18n\":\"defaultsTab\",\"label\":\"Defaults\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"Label\",\"i18n\":\"defaults\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/defaults\"},{\"type\":\"Label\",\"i18n\":\"request\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/request\"},{\"type\":\"Label\",\"i18n\":\"computed\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/computed\"}]},{\"type\":\"Category\",\"name\":\"messages\",\"i18n\":\"messagesTab\",\"label\":\"Messages in the schema\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"Label\",\"i18n\":\"messages\"},{\"type\":\"Control\",\"scope\":\"#/properties/spoken\"}]}]}]}}"), }
